                  <quote source="db:5564" n="IX (ad IX.40ab)">de ltar grub mtha' 4 las <expan>slob dpon ni</expan> <expan>phyi rol</expan> gyi don <expan>khas len</expan> <expan>pa'i</expan> tshe <expan>mdo sde</expan> pa ltar mdzad la | 
