               <gap reason="omitted"/><pb n="145"/><lb n="92b3"/><seg type="shared" xml:id="ex045042026-03-2012-59-22" status="reviewed"> 3 pa 'thad pa'i <expan>phyogs</expan> ngos bzung pa ni ¦ phyabs phyi ma 'di nyid ring par mngon te | <expan>'di dag gi</expan> yab sras 2 kyi gsungs pa dang 'thun shas che bar snang zhing ¦ de <lb n="92b4"/> 'dra de ni dang sems kyi | sgyu yin zhes pa'i grel par ¦ <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5554">lha</rs> <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5549">shag</rs> <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:5602">nyi ma sbas pa</rs> 3 ka'i gsung dang dang dang 'thun <expan>pa'i phyir</expan> dang ¦ <expan>rtags</expan> 'dzin gyi seMs zhes pa'i ming don la dpyad na 'thad <expan>pa'i phyir</expan> dang ¦ 
