               <pb n="106b"/><lb n="106b3"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex045042026-03-2013-18-28" status="reviewed">3 pa bshad tshul 2 <expan>gsung</expan> pa'i dgos pa ni <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="db:3831">sngon gyi mkhas mchog phya pa <expan>chen po</expan></rs> laswo pas ¦ <expan>grags</expan> pa la <expan>2 te</expan>: brda'i grags pa dang ¦ tha snyad kyi <expan>grags</expan> pa 2 ¦ 
